st this method with a generator script, focusing on saving the generated PNGs. I'll need a way to organize and combine the separate PNG charts in the workspace for the final output.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nimport matplotlib\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.patches as patches\n\nprint('Matplotlib backend:', matplotlib.get_backend())\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking Matplotlib backend","toolSummary":"Check Matplotlib backend"}}]}
