{"step_index":129,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:20:54Z","thinking":"Initial plan is to create a script that generates flowcharts for each chapter, along with a combined flowchart image. Chapter 1 will be constructed with 22 missions arranged into four columns. The dimensions are noted.\n\n\nDimensions are set: 8 inches wide, 12 inches high. Each chapter will have a four-column arrangement. Column positions and mission assignments are defined for Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Arrow connection rules are established, primarily vertical within columns and horizontal between column bottoms and the next column's top. The \"Discharge Time\" mission in Chapter 1 and each chapter's concluding mission will connect to the subsequent chapter.\n\n\nChapter 4 details are finalized with 25 missions across four columns. Chapter 5's structure is defined as a hierarchical layout, accommodating seven missions and three branching endings. The complete flowchart, incorporating all chapters and missions, is planned for a comprehensive master canvas.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete Python script that renders all 5 individual GTA VI chapter flowcharts and 1 master combined flowchart into high-resolution PNG files.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.patches as patches\nimport os\nimport shutil\n\n# Output directories\nWORKSPACE_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\Downloads\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\"\nARTIFACT_DIR = r\"C:\\Users\\<user>\\.gemini\\antigravity-cli\\brain\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\"\n\n# Styling Constants\nBG_COLOR = \"#0c1017\"\nTEXT_COLOR = \"#f8fafc\"\nSUBTEXT_COLOR = \"#94a3b8\"\n\nSTYLES = {\n    \"normal\": {\n        \"bg\": \"#161d2b\",\n        \"border\": \"#00d4ff\",       # Neon Cyan\n        \"title\": \"#38bdf8\",\n        \"badge_bg\": \"#083344\",\n        \"badge_fg\": \"#38bdf8\"\n    },\n    \"milestone\": {\n        \"bg\": \"#231528\",\n        \"border\": \"#ff007f\",       # Neon Magenta / Pink\n        \"title\": \"#fb7185\",\n        \"badge_bg\": \"#4c0519\",\n        \"badge_fg\": \"#ff007f\"\n    },\n    \"heist\": {\n        \"bg\": \"#281e10\",\n        \"border\": \"#f59e0b\",       # Amber / Gold\n        \"title\": \"#fde047\",\n        \"badge_bg\": \"#451a03\",\n        \"badge_fg\": \"#fbbf24\"\n    },\n    \"point_of_no_return\": {\n        \"bg\": \"#300e18\",\n        \"border\": \"#ef4444\",       # Crimson\n        \"title\": \"#fca5a5\",\n        \"badge_bg\": \"#7f1d1d\",\n        \"badge_fg\": \"#fca5a5\"\n    },\n    \"ending\": {\n        \"bg\": \"#0c2820\",\n        \"border\": \"#10b981\",       # Emerald\n        \"title\": \"#34d399\",\n        \"badge_bg\": \"#064e3b\",\n        \"badge_fg\": \"#34d399\"\n    }\n}\n\ndef draw_card(ax, x, y, w, h, title, subtitle=\"\", badge=\"\", card_type=\"normal\", fontsize=9):\n    st = STYLES.get(card_type, STYLES[\"normal\"])\n    \n    rect = patches.FancyBboxPatch(\n        (x, y), w, h,\n        boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.03,rounding_size=0.15\",\n        linewidth=1.6,\n        edgecolor=st[\"border\"],\n        facecolor=st[\"bg\"],\n        zorder=3\n    )\n    ax.add_patch(rect)\n    \n    if badge:\n        ax.text(\n            x + w/2, y + h - 0.16,\n            badge.upper(),\n            ha=\"center\", va=\"center\",\n            fontsize=fontsize - 2.5,\n            fontweight=\"bold\",\n            color=st[\"badge_fg\"],\n            bbox=dict(boxstyle=\"round,pad=0.22\", facecolor=st[\"badge_bg\"], edgecolor=st[\"border\"], lw=0.8),\n            zorder=4\n        )\n        title_y = y + h/2 + 0.04\n        sub_y = y + 0.22\n    else:\n        title_y = y + h/2 + 0.14 if subtitle else y + h/2\n        sub_y = y + h/2 - 0.20\n\n    ax.text(\n        x + w/2, title_y,\n        title,\n        ha=\"center\", va=\"center\",\n        fontsize=fontsize,\n        fontweight=\"bold\",\n        color=st[\"title\"],\n        zorder=4\n    )\n    \n    if subtitle:\n        ax.text(\n            x + w/2, sub_y,\n            subtitle,\n            ha=\"center\", va=\"center\",\n            fontsize=fontsize - 2.2,\n            color=SUBTEXT_COLOR,\n            zorder=4\n        )\n\ndef draw_arrow(ax, p1, p2, color=\"#38bdf8\", lw=1.6, rad=0.0):\n    conn = f\"arc3,rad={rad}\" if rad != 0 else \"arc3,rad=0\"\n    ax.annotate(\n        \"\",\n        xy=p2, xytext=p1,\n        arrowprops=dict(\n            arrowstyle=\"->,head_width=0.32,head_length=0.42\",\n            color=color,\n            lw=lw,\n            shrinkA=4,\n            shrinkB=4,\n            connectionstyle=conn\n        ),\n        zorder=2\n    )\n\ndef setup_header(ax, title, subtitle, w_total, y_top=11.5):\n    ax.text(\n        w_total / 2, y_top,\n        title,\n        ha=\"center\", va=\"center\",\n        fontsize=16,\n        fontweight=\"bold\",\n        color=\"#ffffff\",\n        zorder=5\n    )\n    ax.text(\n        w_total / 2, y_top - 0.45,\n        subtitle,\n        ha=\"center\", va=\"center\",\n        fontsize=10.5,\n        color=\"#38bdf8\",\n        zorder=5\n    )\n\n# ==========================================\n# 1. CHAPTER 1: JUST LIKE PARADISE\n# ==========================================\ndef render_chapter_1():\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(19, 12), dpi=200)\n    fig.patch.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_xlim(0, 19)\n    ax.set_ylim(0, 12)\n    ax.axis(\"off\")\n    \n    setup_header(\n        ax,\n        \"GRAND THEFT AUTO VI — CHAPTER 1: JUST LIKE PARADISE\",\n        \"Setting: Leonida Keys (Key Lento, Hamlet State Penitentiary, Southwind Marina) | Missions 1 - 22\",\n        19\n    )\n    \n    w, h = 3.6, 1.15\n    cols_x = [1.0, 5.5, 10.0, 14.5]\n    \n    m_col1 = [\n        (\"1. Prologue\", \"Lucia Prison Counselor Interview\", \"Intro\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"2. Gone Fishing\", \"Jason & Donnie Skim Shipment\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"3. Gear Up\", \"Pick up Longarm for Brian\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"4. Just a Scratch\", \"Ganado Repair & Respray\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"5. Lab Fees\", \"Brian's Rent Collection\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"6. Unwanted Attention\", \"Cal & Jason Drive to Hamlet\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n    ]\n    \n    m_col2 = [\n        (\"7. Pipework\", \"Marina DIY & Maintenance\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"8. Hey Arnold!\", \"Track Down Cargo Broker\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"9. Island Dreams\", \"Keys Ocean Diving Activity\", \"Diving Unlocked\", \"milestone\"),\n        (\"10. Feng Shui\", \"Move Smuggler Furniture\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"11. Coming Home\", \"Lucia Released & Reunited\", \"Lucia Release\", \"milestone\"),\n    ]\n    \n    m_col3 = [\n        (\"12. Clean Up After Donnie\", \"Retrieve Hamlet Drop Package\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"13. Buck Me\", \"Setup Banking App & Finances\", \"Banking System\", \"milestone\"),\n        (\"14. Down to Earth\", \"Marina Smuggling Drop\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"15. Clear Skies\", \"Deal with Southwind Bikers\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"16. Day Release\", \"Rusty Anchor Night Out\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"17. Swamped\", \"Kingfishers Smugglers Meet\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n    ]\n    \n    m_col4 = [\n        (\"18. Don Gone\", \"Clear Donnie's Trailer\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"19. Recalibration\", \"Cal Intervention & Reset\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"20. Tourist Trap\", \"Accept Mattia's Pickup Job\", \"Transition Starts\", \"milestone\"),\n        (\"21. Home Sweet Home\", \"Key Lento Ambush Fallout\", \"\", \"normal\"),\n        (\"22. Discharge Time\", \"Chapter Climax & Evacuation\", \"Ch. 1 Climax\", \"point_of_no_return\"),\n    ]\n    \n    # Render Columns\n    all_cards = [m_col1, m_col2, m_col3, m_col4]\n    for c_idx, col in enumerate(all_cards):\n        cx = cols_x[c_idx]\n        y_start = 10.0\n        gap = 1.45\n        for r_idx, (t, sub, badge, ctype) in enumerate(col):\n            cy = y_start - r_idx * gap\n            draw_card(ax, cx, cy, w, h, t, sub, badge, ctype)\n            # Arrow down within col\n            if r_idx < len(col) - 1:\n                draw_arrow(ax, (cx + w/2, cy), (cx + w/2, cy - (gap - h)), color=\"#38bdf8\")\n    \n    # Inter-column connectors\n    # Col 1 bottom (item 5: y = 10 - 5*1.45 = 2.75) -> Col 2 top (item 0: y = 10.0)\n    draw_arrow(ax, (cols_x[0] + w, 2.75 + h/2), (cols_x[1], 10.0 + h/2), color=\"#f43f5e\", rad=-0.25)\n    \n    # Col 2 bottom (item 4: y = 10 - 4*1.45 = 4.2) -> Col 3 top (item 0: y = 10.0)\n    draw_arrow(ax, (cols_x[1] + w, 4.2 + h/2), (cols_x[2], 10.0 + h/2), color=\"#f43f5e\", rad=-0.25)\n    \n    # Col 3 bottom (item 5: y = 2.75) -> Col 4 top (item 0: y = 10.0)\n    draw_arrow(ax, (cols_x[2] + w, 2.75 + h/2), (cols_x[3], 10.0 + h/2), color=\"#f43f5e\", rad=-0.25)\n    \n    # Next Chapter Indicator\n    ch2_x, ch2_y = cols_x[3], 2.75 - 1.5\n    draw_card(ax, ch2_x, ch2_y, w, 0.9, \"→ TRANSITION TO CHAPTER 2\", \"Destination: Port Gellhorn & Kelly County\", \"\", \"point_of_no_return\")\n    draw_arrow(ax, (cols_x[3] + w/2, 2.75), (cols_x[3] + w/2, ch2_y + 0.9), color=\"#ef4444\")\n    \n    out_path = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"flowchart_chapter_1.png\")\n    plt.savefig(out_path, bbox_inches=\"tight\", facecolor=BG_COLOR)\n    plt.close()\n    print(\"Saved:\", out_path)\n\n# ==========================================\n# 2. CHAPTER 2: PARADISE LOST\n# ==========================================\ndef render_chapter_2():\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(19, 12), dpi=200)\n    fig.patch.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_facecolor(BG_COLOR)\n    ax.set_xlim(0, 19)\n    ax.set_ylim(0, 12)\n    ax.axis(\"off\")\n    \n    setup_header(\n        ax,\n        \"GRAND THEFT AUTO VI — CHAPTER 2: PARADISE LOST\",\n        \"Setting: Port